---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

// Media files for hydrogel research
const mediaItems = [
  "/hydrogel1.jpg",
  "/hydrogel2.jpg", 
  "/hydrogel3.jpg"
];
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16">
    <header class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-6 font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-white">
        Water Release Dynamics of Agricultural Hydrogels
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral">
        A statistical study of hydrogel-based water release in agriculture.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Research Overview</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral">This statistical research project focused on analyzing the water retention capabilities of different soil types when combined with hydrogel technology. The study aimed to understand how hydrogel polymers interact with various soil compositions and their potential applications in agriculture and water conservation.</p>
        <p class="text-neutral mt-4">Through rigorous experimental design and statistical analysis, we measured and compared the water holding capacity across multiple soil samples, providing valuable insights into sustainable water management practices and soil improvement techniques.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Methodology</h2>
        <ul class="text-neutral list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Collection and preparation of diverse soil samples (sandy, clay, loamy, etc.)</li>
          <li>Controlled hydrogel application at varying concentrations</li>
          <li>Standardized water retention testing procedures</li>
          <li>Time-series measurements of moisture content</li>
          <li>Statistical sampling and experimental controls</li>
          <li>Multiple trial repetitions for data reliability</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- MEDIA GALLERY SECTION -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-8 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Research Visualizations</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          {mediaItems.map((media, index) => (
            <a 
              href={media} 
              target="_blank" 
              class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-neutral/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:border-primary/30"
            >
              <Image
                src={media}
                alt={`Hydrogel research visualization ${index + 1}`}
                width={200}
                height={200}
                class="h-40 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">View Full Size</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Statistical Tools & Techniques</h2>
        <ul class="text-neutral list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Descriptive statistics for data summarization</li>
          <li>Hypothesis testing (t-tests, ANOVA) for group comparisons</li>
          <li>Regression analysis for relationship modeling</li>
          <li>Correlation analysis between soil properties and water retention</li>
          <li>Data visualization for pattern recognition</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Key Findings</h2>
        <ul class="text-neutral list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
          <li>Quantified improvement in water retention across all soil types</li>
          <li>Optimal hydrogel concentrations for different soil compositions</li>
          <li>Statistical significance of water conservation benefits</li>
          <li>Correlations between soil texture and hydrogel effectiveness</li>
          <li>Practical applications for agricultural water management</li>
          <li>Environmental implications for water-scarce regions</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-primary">Applications & Impact</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral">The research findings have practical applications in sustainable agriculture, particularly in regions facing water scarcity. The statistical models developed can help farmers and agricultural engineers optimize water usage, improve crop yields, and implement more efficient irrigation strategies using hydrogel technology.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hnxXGPdoD94UqAhUOo6pSdqGZ0cmSASf/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" class="rounded-full bg-primary px-8 py-4 text-white font-medium hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors after:ml-2 after:content-[url(/external.svg)]">
          Research Paper
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>